                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/178.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to Liberia to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Kanre-Lahun boundary agreement has been ratified by the senate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crum.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
